window.EN={"1":"Passing Fort Danzig, Leif's \"Liberation Army\" presses on along the road to Munster.","2":"Before their eyes, the greatest river of the Thracian peninsula, the great Thracia River, reveals its vast form.","3":"The great Thracia River, which with its abundant waters has until now bestowed many blessings on the region of northern Thracia.","4":"Once across this great Thracia River, Munster lies right before them.","5":"The great river of Thracia... Whenever I see it, this vastness captivates me.","6":"And how pure this water is. Truly the blessing of the earth mother goddess Ethnia.","7":"Is that so? To me it looks like a river of bright red blood...","8":"Certainly, this great river has given us many blessings.","9":"But for that very reason, it invites people's insatiable greed,","10":"and countless times until now, battles have been fought over this river.","11":"The former King of Leonster, your grandfather, Prince, also fell in battle at this river.","12":"That's right... My grandfather, at this river...","13":"To be exact, not here, but at the Great Thracia Bridge, located farther downstream.","14":"Through Connacht's sudden betrayal, the army collapsed entirely, and the King too was killed.","15":"This river is easy to defend and hard to attack. Therefore the enemy, too, will come with a powerful lineup to stop us here.","16":"Prince Leif, this battle is expected to be harder than any battle so far.","17":"I ask that you face it with your mind braced...","18":"Saias, enough. Leave now!","19":"No. I will stay by your side to the end, Count.","20":"If you wish to save me, first listen to what I say.","21":"You remember as well, surely.","22":"My daughter Aida was killed by that Manfroy, trying to protect you.","23":"I hid you in a church far from any village, and withstood Manfroy's persistent threats.","24":"That I am exposed on this frontier as a mere army commander is all Manfroy's doing.","25":"More than ten years since then... Your ability was recognized, and you rose even to court priest of Velthomer.","26":"Trusted by His Majesty, I rejoiced that not even Manfroy could touch you now.","27":"But with His Highness Julius's awakening, the power of the Loptr Church has come to surpass even the Emperor's.","28":"Saias, the Brand of Fala has appeared on you, has it not?","29":"That is something neither Prince Julius nor Princess Julia had.","30":"And it is for that reason that Manfroy feared you.","31":"Saias, preserve your life. You are a warrior of Fala... You must leave behind the blood of Velthomer.","32":"For now, hide that fact and build up your strength.","33":"Lord Saias, it has been a long time.","34":"General Reinhardt! Why are you here?","35":"I heard that Princess Ishtar had returned home. Were you not with her?","36":"As I am anxious about my sister, I decided to remain for a while.","37":"Besides, I am told Lady Ishtar no longer needs me.","38":"The princess said so?","39":"Yes. Because of Lord Julius as well, she told me not to concern myself with her anymore...","40":"......","41":"Lord Reinhardt.","42":"It is a hard thing to say, but I have heard that Lady Olwen has gone over to the enemy?","43":"...Yes.","44":"But Olwen is still a child. She has surely been deceived. I believe she will understand if I talk to her.","45":"I understand how you feel, but she is a full-grown adult now.","46":"She is not forever the girl running after you.","47":"She has her own way of living. That, at least, you should understand.","48":"Olwen's way of living... Are you saying, Father, that there is a way of living different from mine?","49":"Yes...","50":"But in any case, it would be well for you to talk it over once. If there is a chance, that is...","51":"Brother!...","52":"When I saw the Gelben Ritter I thought it might be, and it was you after all!","53":"Olwen. It's been a long time... I'm glad to see you.","54":"Brother... I...","55":"Never mind. We'll talk at leisure later.","56":"For now, I just want to be glad you're safe. Everyone is worried.","57":"Olwen... let's go back home together.","58":"No... I will not return to Friege.","59":"I will go home after taking the children back from Loptr... That is what I decided.","60":"Olwen, please. Do as I say.","61":"You're my precious sister. I don't want to lose you!","62":"As one human being, I thought, agonized, and suffered through it, and made this decision.","63":"Even at your word, Brother, I cannot change it.","64":"Then... we will be enemies. Are you saying you'll fight me, Olwen?","65":"If you mean to bar our way, Brother... then, when that time comes...","66":"Heh... You seem to be serious...","67":"It is indeed as Lord Saias says. It seems you've grown up. All right, enough... do as you like.","68":"This is my last feeling as your brother. Take it!","69":"This is!? Isn't this the sword you treasured most, Brother!","70":"Yes...","71":"It is the holy sword I received from Lady Ishtar, but I no longer need it. You should use it.","72":"But why? When you treasured it so...","73":"This conversation is over. Return to your army, Olwen!","74":"The next time we meet on the battlefield, I will show no mercy, sister or not! Understood!!","75":"The enemy has come that far... Enough, Saias. Leave!","76":"No, I will stay with you after all, Count...","77":"Silence! Can you not do as I say! Go!","78":"Please wait! I...","79":"Count... So I... must not... die after all...","80":"...Good, now! Drop the bridges! Give the Gelben Ritter the order to attack!","81":"Now! Drop the bridges!","82":"The enemy is drawing near at last! On the name of the Gelben Ritter, do not let them near this castle!","83":"We have crossed the river at last.","84":"A river where many have shed blood... hm. I feel I somehow understand what you were trying to say, August.","85":"...Blood once spilled does not return.","86":"What matters is how to make that blood worth something.","87":"Now, Munster is very near. Let us hurry on, Prince Leif.","88":"The far side of the river is full of imperial soldiers. I hear there are some among them who use terrifying magic.","89":"It's dangerous to go without any preparation. Take this holy water with you.","90":"The great Thracia River is wide...","91":"Advance the straightforward way, and you'll take the Empire's all-out attack head-on before you're even across.","92":"If you use this Warp staff to, say, attack the imperial army from behind, it ought to get a good deal easier.","93":"The great Thracia River is wide...","94":"So if you don't advance carefully, you'll get separated in no time.","95":"Use this Rescue staff and you can bring someone right back to your side... It's a handy staff, this one.","96":"You shall advance no farther!","97":"The Empire... will not lose... gah!","98":"...I have nothing to say.","99":"Is this, too, fate... Forgive me...","100":"So this... is it...","101":"...We'll meet again...","102":"Withdraw... You cannot defeat me..."};
